          "start": 1105
        },
        "quote": "(5) Consulting services.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "584105c1-cf15-56a7-aa19-5e95cf80ed9e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1769,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:12",
          "start": 1130
        },
        "quote": "(d) Application Period. Applications requesting an allocation of monies from the housing trust fund will be accepted year-round in order to accommodate the varying needs of affordable housing providers, developers and supportive services providers. The City may from time to time, and as funding levels allow, issue a request for proposals seeking applicants who may be desirous of receiving proceeds from the housing trust fund in order to support the acquisition, rehabilitation and development of affordable housing and/or emergency shelter and supportive services necessary to maintain independent living with dignity in the community.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "b23af63b-4f53-5203-8bd7-3280d1dcd7ab",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1881,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:13",
          "start": 1770
        },
        "quote": "(e) Affordable Housing Trust Fund Review Committee – Responsibilities. This Committee shall be responsible for:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "7901b038-db39-53ce-90bb-ec810c28c5c1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2113,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:14",
          "start": 1882
        },
        "quote": "(1) Ensuring that strong preference will be given to unrestricted donations. Donor-advised, or otherwise restricted, funds may be considered, but must go through the same review and approval process as the funding-decision process.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "aea07db4-521e-5f5f-ad20-5d75bef84009",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2362,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:15",
          "start": 2114
        },
        "quote": "(2) Conducting a review of applications requesting an allocation of monies from the housing trust fund, as set out in subsection (f) of this section, and then making a recommendation to the City Manager regarding whether or not to allocate funding.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "e0b406ef-7a32-59bb-92dd-f5242e96675a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2834,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:16",
          "start": 2363
        },
        "quote": "(3) Preparing an annual report, in conjunction with the Department of Administrative and Financial Services, not later than July 1st of each year, concerning the activities of the preceding calendar year. Such reports shall be prepared by the Chairperson of the Affordable Housing Trust Fund Review Committee, shall cover all financial transactions involving monies raised and received, including gifts and donations, and shall thereafter be posted on the City’s website.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "e54bd3dc-e85c-544c-a10d-1fc8d0d3cf31",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3226,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:17",
          "start": 2835
        },
        "quote": "(f) Review of Applications. Each application requesting an allocation of monies held in the housing trust fund must be fully completed, with any required documentation attached. The Affordable Housing Trust Fund Review Committee shall review any fully completed application within 30 days of the date on which it is submitted. The following factors will be considered as part of such review:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "77f1feae-978a-5d80-a5e4-9962c2fa97c3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3544,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:18",
          "start": 3227
        },
        "quote": "(1) Would the project increase the supply of affordable rental housing, including the funding of rental assistance programs, for qualified households earning 80 percent or less AMI? Funding for projects that will serve households at 50 percent or less and 30 percent or less AMI are preferred, to the extent possible.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 19",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "f8bd2a68-b01e-5247-b841-c7719784a099",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3666,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:19",
          "start": 3545
        },
        "quote": "(2) Would the project increase the supply of for-sale housing for qualified households earning 80 percent or less of AMI?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 20",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 20,
          "component_id": "53e6559c-7012-511f-815b-a8316c08f807",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3862,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:20",
          "start": 3667
        },
        "quote": "(3) Would the project support homebuyer assistance programs, including by way of example down payment and mortgage assistance programs, for qualified households earning 80 percent or less of AMI?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:20#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 21",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 21,
          "component_id": "c841bd25-38a5-531f-a6b7-e2fb2aa1f708",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4158,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:21",
          "start": 3863
        },
        "quote": "(4) Would the project preserve rental housing, including the funding of rental assistance programs, for qualified households earning 80 percent or less of AMI? Funding for projects that will serve households at 50 percent or less and 30 percent or less AMI are preferred, to the extent possible.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:21#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 22",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 22,
          "component_id": "70478fbb-c21d-5595-b8f9-d222fe184243",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4323,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:22",
          "start": 4159
        },
        "quote": "(5) Would the project provide for the development of permanent supportive housing for unsheltered persons, and for supportive services associated with such housing?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:22#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 23",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 23,
          "component_id": "44e52d29-9ec9-5ed9-be18-471cd45514b7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4566,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:23",
          "start": 4324
        },
        "quote": "(6) Would proposals for supportive services, in combination with categories in subsections (f)(1) through (f)(5) of this section or stand-alone, enhance access to or success in safe affordable housing for households at 80 percent or less AMI?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:23#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 24",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 24,
          "component_id": "777cb044-2564-5176-92b6-f5c67009dc3b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4767,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:24",
          "start": 4567
        },
        "quote": "(7) Would the project be a strategic investment leading to the stabilization or revitalization of a neighborhood or promote a mixed-income approach to affordable housing either by project or location?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:24#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 25",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 25,
          "component_id": "390d5c56-f025-595b-a908-9a7fcbd685b9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4975,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:25",
          "start": 4768
        },
        "quote": "(8) Would the project, if new construction, be compatible with the design character of the neighborhood and/or advance high-quality design standards including “crime prevention through environmental design”?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:25#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 26",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 26,
          "component_id": "da292fa9-68fb-5227-a11e-82d22b1359d4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5057,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:26",
          "start": 4976
        },
        "quote": "(9) Have total development and project costs and courses of funds been submitted?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:26#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 27",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 27,
          "component_id": "c2c9eb23-0a77-573b-92e7-7db93025de39",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5218,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:27",
          "start": 5058
        },
        "quote": "(10) Have future operational costs and provision for any applicant-provided or partner-provided supportive services been submitted and satisfactorily addressed?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:27#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 28",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 28,
          "component_id": "8be6425a-e9f8-5ea3-9663-4e3a832e1ac5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5317,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:28",
          "start": 5219
        },
        "quote": "(11) Does the experience and financial stability of the applicant indicate likely project success?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:28#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 29",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 29,
          "component_id": "6735b91f-13ad-5147-aee9-00d4ecfd5a84",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5425,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:29",
          "start": 5318
        },
        "quote": "(12) Do all elements of the proposal comply with City ordinances and other applicable laws and regulations?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:29#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 30",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 30,
          "component_id": "9423f7e8-5e41-57f5-a59d-85d1b88038a8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5548,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:30",
          "start": 5426
        },
        "quote": "(13) Are there other sources available that could fund this proposal (i.e., are housing trust fund dollars really needed)?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:30#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 31",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 31,
          "component_id": "2c068a67-68fc-5b28-8c8e-b0b2d1867d7d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 5686,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:31",
          "start": 5549
        },
        "quote": "(14) How does the request meet a priority need identified in the Citywide Housing Market Study and Strategy or any addendums and updates?",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:31#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 32",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 32,
          "component_id": "1655fa4d-df6c-54db-8ea2-a8934f59a554",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 6314,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:32",
          "start": 5687
        },
        "quote": "(g) Funding Recommendation – Decision. The Committee, after considering each of the factors noted in subsection (f) of this section, shall forward its recommendation regarding whether or not to allocate funding to the City Manager within 30 days of the last date on which it met to consider the application. The City Manager shall review the recommendation and may return it to the Committee for further review. At such time as the City Manager believes the proposal is ready for action, the City Manager shall forward the proposal to the Governing Body with a recommendation. The decision of the Governing Body shall be final.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:32#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 33",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 33,
          "component_id": "6bfcf5da-6926-55be-8607-239afab6e778",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 6356,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:33",
          "start": 6315
        },
        "quote": "(h) Administration of Housing Trust Fund.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:33#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 34",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 34,
          "component_id": "a9a11778-bc2d-5f7a-9753-4fd5eb7bfa1e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 6692,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:34",
          "start": 6357
        },
        "quote": "(1) The housing trust fund application and review process shall be administered by the Director of Planning and Development or designee, who may promulgate rules and regulations governing the processes and procedures associated with the same; provided, however, that such rules and regulations must remain consistent with this chapter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:34#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.070 block 35",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 35,
          "component_id": "3a3d89ac-2bab-5ac3-92ac-72692f5e2fde",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 7112,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.070:block:35",
          "start": 6693
        },
        "quote": "(2) The housing trust fund account and monies shall be administered by the Director of Administrative and Financial Services or designee, who may promulgate rules and regulations governing the processes and procedures associated with donations to and expenditures from such fund; provided, however, that such rules and regulations must remain consistent with this chapter. (Ord. 20554 § 1, 3-18-25. Formerly 2.105.070.)",
